id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18887::$$$message_0152_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, it's Shirou."::
18888::$$$message_0152_0000_0001$$$::"Oh, hey... [wait canskip=0 time=500][hffacechg chara=士郎 face=悩 layer=1 time=200][l][say storage=HIRI3_SHI_0020 _name=士郎]Um."::
18889::$$$message_0152_0000_0002$$$::"Illyasviel, what were you thinking, bringing Berserker out in broad daylight?"::
18890::$$$message_0152_0000_0003$$$::"Well, I don't want the other Masters getting in the way of where I want to go."::
19264::$$$message_0152_0000_0004$$$::"The other Masters... Wait...[hfchance layer=1][l][say storage=HIRI3_SHI_0050 _name=士郎]you don't mean...!"::
19265::$$$message_0152_0000_0005$$$::"Hehehe. We're probably all headed for the same place. But Saber can't go with you."::
19266::$$$message_0152_0000_0006$$$::"I see. So you received that letter as well."::
19267::$$$message_0152_0000_0007$$$::"Yeah. I'm just doing it to pass the time, but it could be fun if Shirou goes, too. [hffacechg chara=イリヤ face=喜 layer=0 time=200][l][say storage=HIRI3_IRI_0050 _name=イリヤ]Hey, why don't we go together?"::
19268::$$$message_0152_0000_0008$$$::"...Sorry, Illya. I promised Saber I'd bring her to the onsen today."::
19269::$$$message_0152_0000_0009$$$::"Hmmm... [wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=イリヤ face=怒 layer=0 time=200][hfchance layer=0][l][say storage=HIRI3_IRI_0080 _name=イリヤ]That's fine. I can take you there by force."::
19270::$$$message_0152_0001_0000$$$::"Don't worry, I'll hold back. We can't go together if you're dead, after all.[lr]::
19271::$$$message_0152_0001_0001$$$::Go, Berserker!"::
19272::$$$message_0152_0001_0002$$$::"[wacky len=5][line len=3]!!!"::
�